Becoming.Dormancy.consumed : Becoming.Dormancy.web.Consumed Becoming.Dormancy.Condition.pool
Becoming.Dormancy.classes : Becoming.Dormancy.web.RenewingIn Becoming.Dormancy.Formation.early ∧
  Becoming.Dormancy.web.ConsumingIn Becoming.Dormancy.Formation.late ∧
    Becoming.Dormancy.joined.ConsumingIn Becoming.Dormancy.Formation.early ∧
      ¬Becoming.Dormancy.joined.RenewingIn Becoming.Dormancy.Formation.early
